WEBVTT

1
00:00:12.005 --> 00:00:21.488
"Wizard!" The king's face was red.

2
00:00:21.488 --> 00:00:24.273
"Do something!"

3
00:00:24.273 --> 00:00:33.435
"I'll look for a spell!" Tom said.

4
00:00:33.435 --> 00:00:36.039
Tom ran past the Royal Kitchen.

5
00:00:36.039 --> 00:00:39.601
"Tom! Help!" Cook cried.

6
00:00:39.601 --> 00:00:42.453
"All our food has disappeared.

7
00:00:42.453 --> 00:00:44.969
There is nothing to eat!"

8
00:00:44.969 --> 00:00:56.160
Then Tom heard screams from outside.

9
00:00:56.160 --> 00:01:01.509
He hurried to the Royal Stables.

10
00:01:01.509 --> 00:01:08.240
All the horses were running around the yard.

11
00:01:08.240 --> 00:01:14.101
The tiger was chasing them!

12
00:01:14.101 --> 00:01:18.266
"Help, Tom!" the stable boy cried.

13
00:01:18.266 --> 00:01:22.159
"Do something, Wizard!" Dirk shouted.

14
00:01:22.159 --> 00:01:27.932
"I'll try!" Tom called.

15
00:01:27.932 --> 00:01:31.386
He raced to the royal grandmother's room.

16
00:01:31.386 --> 00:01:34.311
He knocked hard on her door.

17
00:01:34.311 --> 00:01:39.332
"Your Majesty? May I come in?"

18
00:01:39.332 --> 00:01:44.740
A servant opened the door.

19
00:01:44.740 --> 00:01:47.389
Tom blinked in surprise.

20
00:01:47.390 --> 00:01:50.832
The royal grandmother sat on the king's throne.

21
00:01:50.832 --> 00:01:54.371
On a table was a huge feast.

22
00:01:54.371 --> 00:01:57.969
The royal grandmother waved happily at Tom.

23
00:01:57.969 --> 00:02:00.806
"Wizard!" she cried.

24
00:02:00.806 --> 00:02:03.572
"The wishing cap is wonderful!

25
00:02:03.573 --> 00:02:06.751
All my wishes came true!"

26
00:02:06.751 --> 00:02:10.879
Tom gulped. "Yes, Your Majesty, but . . .

27
00:02:10.879 --> 00:02:14.286
Your wishes have made everyone else unhappy."

28
00:02:14.286 --> 00:02:18.537
"What?" said the royal grandmother.

29
00:02:18.537 --> 00:02:22.117
"The king has no throne," Tom went on.

30
00:02:22.117 --> 00:02:24.521
"There's nothing to eat.

31
00:02:24.521 --> 00:02:27.576
And your tiger is scaring the horses.

32
00:02:27.576 --> 00:02:30.130
Please undo your wishes!"

33
00:02:30.130 --> 00:02:32.497
The royal grandmother frowned.

34
00:02:32.497 --> 00:02:34.855
She folded her arms.

35
00:02:34.855 --> 00:02:37.376
"Too bad!" she said.

36
00:02:37.376 --> 00:02:45.780
"I will not undo my wishes!"
